        "value": "Autonomous Robotics Solution Project",
        "aiNotes": ""
      },
      "description": {
        "value": "Students work in collaborative teams to design, implement, and refine an autonomous robotic solution addressing a defined real-world challenge, utilizing agile project management tools to track development. The project requires students to document their design process through user stories and flowcharts, implement modular code in an object-oriented language, and conduct systematic debugging against established test cases. The final submission is a multimodal presentation evaluating the functional prototype against stakeholder requirements and the broader enterprising impact of autonomous systems.",
