        "aiNotes": ""
      },
      "conditions": {
        "value": "• Collaborative project team (3 students)\n• Agile project management documentation (e.g., Kanban boards, sprint logs)\n• Design portfolio (5–7 A3 pages or equivalent digital media) including user stories, flowcharts, pseudocode, and systematic testing/debugging records\n• Functional robotic prototype demonstrating autonomous capability\n• Multimodal presentation (maximum 5 minutes) evaluating the solution against design criteria, stakeholder requirements, and broader enterprising impact\n• Supervised class time for iterative development and testing",
